    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #82 Quantitative Review & Parameter Mutation\nForensic analysis of Cycle #82 (PF: 0.85, Net P&L: \u20b9-15.17, Fees: \u20b944.28) indicates that statutory fee drag is the primary detractor to profitability, turning gross-positive or scratch trades (such as ICICIBANK and late-session TATASTEEL) into net losses. Additionally, cyclical names experienced premature stop-outs at the 0.68% threshold due to standard intraday noise. To mitigate these microstructure headwinds, we are increasing `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` from 2.65x to 2.85x to filter out low-conviction mid-day liquidity sweeps, and widening `min_sl_pct` to 0.72% to give high-beta names breathing room. Concurrently, we are tightening `min_target_pct` to 1.05% and lowering `breakeven_trigger_r` to 0.90R to lock in gains earlier, reduce EOD square-off exposure, and overcome the fixed fee hurdle."
